{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>This is a camp of Elohim.</b> My camp, which the angels of Elohim encountered — there is no doubt that it is a camp of Elohim, as in the case of וַיִּקְרָא לַמָּקוֹם אֵל בֵּית אֵל (Genesis 28:19), for there Elohim revealed themselves to him." "<b>Mahanaim.</b> Two camps — that of the angels of Elohim and his own, according to the rule of the plural sign that follows a pataḥ from below, which indicates the number two, as in פַּעֲמַיִם, שְׁבוּעַיִם, שְׁנָתַיִם and others. Thus concludes the pericah of Vayetze."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:55.257227388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}